# 📌 One-Line Explanation of Every Feature

| Feature                  | Simple Explanation                                                   |
| ------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Simple**               | Easy-to-learn syntax and fewer complex language features             |
| **Secure**               | Provides controlled execution and avoids direct pointer manipulation |
| **Robust**               | Strong type checking, exception handling, and garbage collection     |
| **Portable**             | Java applications/bytecode can be moved across environments          |
| **Multithreaded**        | Supports concurrent execution of multiple tasks                      |
| **Distributed**          | Supports applications communicating across networks                  |
| **Dynamic**              | Classes can be loaded and linked at runtime                          |
| **Platform Independent** | Same bytecode can run on different platforms with compatible JVMs    |

